19T12:31:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690015","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4176620-1833334318572815","game_id":"steam-4176620","kind":"update","title":"Demo version update (ver 0.1.1)","summary":"Demo version update (ver 0.1.1):Changed conditions for hints appearing and the text within themAdded new visual effectsChanged the demo's ending","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-22T21:42:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318572815","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4176620-1833334318569239","game_id":"steam-4176620","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is now live!","summary":"The demo of the horror game \"The Recipe of Life. A Journey Through Silent Apocalypses\" is now live!In the demo version, you will:Engage in deep conversations with 3 different charactersTake care of yourself and others: cook food and treat strangers to it, earn money by writing articles, bathe, and admire the beauty of the world around youFeel the atmosphere of melancholy and hopeEnjoy the game,Noasaki & Orizori","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-21T15:07:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318569239","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4176620-1831432155573645","game_id":"steam-4176620","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo will be released on May 21, 2026!","summary":"The demo for \"The Recipe for Life. A Journey Through Silent Apocalypses\" will be released on May 21, 2026!We have released 